        "title": "Revision Summary",
        "conceptId": "intro",
        "content": "Before the final quiz, let's review what you learned today:\n\n**Bonjour** (/bɔ̃ʒuʁ/) - Hello / Good Morning\n💡 *Tip: Bon = Good. Jour = Day.*\n\n**Salut** (/saly/) - Hi / Bye (Casual)\n💡 *Tip: Used with friends.*\n\n**Je m'appelle** (/ʒə mapɛl/) - My name is\n💡 *Tip: Literally means 'I call myself'.*\n\n**Merci** (/mɛʁ.si/) - Thank you\n💡 *Tip: Sounds like 'mercy'.*\n\n**Beaucoup** (/bo.ku/) - A lot\n💡 *Tip: Use with 'Merci' for 'Thank you very much'.*",
